## Authentication

Callers authenticate with a bearer token or OIDC; the two are mutually
exclusive, and `{{ env_prefix }}_AUTH_MODE` is normally inferred from which
credentials are set. The Required column below means "required to enable
OIDC": with none of these set, the server starts and serves
unauthenticated. See the [authentication guide](guides/authentication.md)
for setup, mapped multi-subject tokens, and troubleshooting.

