Domain fields are composed in `src/{{ python_module }}/config.py` between the
`CONFIG-FIELDS-START` / `CONFIG-FIELDS-END` sentinels. Each field's
`metadata` supplies its row: `help` is the description, `tags` place it, and
a `wizard: {group: ...}` hint becomes the sub-heading its table renders
under, the same grouping the [configuration generator](configuration-generator.md)
presents. Adding `readme` to a field's `tags` also features it in the
curated README table.
